{"obsah":"<p>Vlasta reports from the weekend marathon of events:</p>\n\n<p><em>I haven't had legs this sore after any weekend this year. On Saturday we were invited to the Around the Republic marathon race in Žacléř, where a group of cyclists set off on a course up to 1,500 km long (crazy people). After the start of the main category we jumped on the newly renovated square, including the new fountain (with permission from the mayor and the race director, of course).</em></p>\n\n<p></p>\n\n<p><em>The next exhibition was about 2 hours' drive away, but we said why not train in such beautiful sunny weather, which we haven't had much of this year. Our target was the nearest and relatively little-known Trial park of the Trutnov club, located at the Trutnov motocross club grounds. In the end we spent almost 2 hours there, including filming the most interesting little jumps.<br></em><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tv/CS6gsLrlw9-/?utm_medium=copy_link\">https://www.instagram.com/tv/CS6gsLrlw9-/?utm_medium=copy_link</a><br><a href=\"https://youtu.be/caAp7WWyPxs\">https://youtu.be/caAp7WWyPxs</a></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/caAp7WWyPxs\n</div></figure>\n\n<p><em>Next we moved on to Rasochy, where about 125 bikers battled for trophies in XC races, including retro categories. The clods of turf in the meadow weren't a problem and the spectators created a great atmosphere, so we pulled out a few sharper tricks, like sitting on the handlebars, performed by Marek Tryner and Matouš Balík.</em></p>\n\n<p><em>And on Sunday I had a lesson with a group of bikers that had already been rescheduled about 3 times, and which stretched from the original 4 hours to almost 8 hours including lunch. The guys went through the absolute basics, and we also threw ourselves at the pump track, forest obstacles and a few attempts on the jumps. To be continued next weekend.</em></p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-5 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2FIMG_2651.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2FIMG_2651.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"193384\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=193384\" class=\"wp-image-193384\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2F239469728_380703910119920_3972009177309239599_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2F239469728_380703910119920_3972009177309239599_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"193383\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=193383\" class=\"wp-image-193383\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2F239398481_380703093453335_557433249711067766_n.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2F239398481_380703093453335_557433249711067766_n.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"193382\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=193382\" class=\"wp-image-193382\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F08%2FIMG_2652.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebas